    {
      "id": "s02",
      "type": "TITLE_CARD",
      "transition": "fade",
      "background": "zoneA",
      "narration": "Welcome back. AirPods 5 landed alongside the new iPhones, and the interesting part isn't the sound — it's where the quiet comes from. Today we're going through the noise cancelling, the features underneath it, and the two prices. So can you cancel noise without plugging the hole?",
