      "narration": "Here's the claim, in Apple's words, on Apple's own product page. Noise out, magic in. Up to one and a half times more active noise cancellation than AirPods 4 — and Apple calls it the industry's best noise cancellation in an open-ear design. Read that last phrase twice, because open-ear means there is no rubber tip sealing your ear canal, which is the whole story of this product, and the reason it is a chip problem rather than a foam one.",
