      "type": "APPLE_STAGE",
      "transition": "push",
      "background": "zoneB",
      "narration": "Battery is where the two models separate for the first time, and the gap is narrower than the price makes it sound. With noise cancellation running, the Wireless Charging Case pair buys you about an extra hour in the ear and two more from the case. Both do the same trick when you're late out of the door: five minutes sitting in the case is worth roughly an hour of listening, which in practice is the number that matters most.",
